{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1000000000000104","type":"group","x":-960,"y":-180,"width":7680,"height":2260,"color":"2","label":"User Flow：三条定位链路"},
		{"id":"1000000000000107","type":"group","x":2760,"y":2720,"width":1940,"height":2160,"color":"1","label":"Key / Difficult Points"},
		{"id":"1000000000000106","type":"group","x":-1440,"y":3900,"width":3880,"height":980,"color":"1","label":"Nested Functions"},
		{"id":"1000000000000105","type":"group","x":-1440,"y":2720,"width":3880,"height":940,"color":"6","label":"Store / Local Storage / Runtime"},
		{"id":"1000000000000103","type":"group","x":1500,"y":-1400,"width":3200,"height":900,"color":"3","label":"Component Communication + API"},
		{"id":"1000000000000102","type":"group","x":-960,"y":-1680,"width":2200,"height":1180,"color":"5","label":"Pages / Components"},
		{"id":"1000000000000101","type":"group","x":-2500,"y":-1400,"width":1260,"height":1760,"color":"4","label":"Project Reading Entry"},
		{"id":"1000000000000108","type":"group","x":1500,"y":-2400,"width":2100,"height":830,"color":"1","label":"Questions / Needs Confirmation"},
		{"id":"2000000000000101","type":"text","text":"## 推荐阅读入口\n\n先按组件和链路看，不要一开始陷进函数细节：\n\n1. `attendance/index.vue`：父页面，业务流程总控。\n2. `AttendanceLocationSelector.vue`：车辆表单子组件。\n3. `locationPermission.js`：扫码打卡的一次性定位权限。\n4. `account.js` + `App.vue`：登录、回前台后的恢复入口。\n5. `locationReporterRuntime.js` -> `locationReporter.js`：持续定位上报链路。","x":-2360,"y":-1300,"width":980,"height":340,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000102","type":"file","file":"travelKnowledge/我的整理/Enhance Skill 整理/location/location.md","x":-2360,"y":-860,"width":980,"height":1080},
		{"id":"2000000000000120","type":"text","text":"## 扫码 1：点击扫码\n\nUser:\n- 点击扫码区域。\n\nFunction:\n- `handleScanCodeTap()`\n\nWork:\n- 防重复扫码。\n- 调起 `uni.scanCode`。","x":-800,"y":-40,"width":390,"height":400,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000113","type":"text","text":"## 父子组件通信\n\nParent -> Child props:\n- `selectedVehicle`\n- `vehicleActive`\n- `vehicleApprovalStatus`\n- `vehicleSubmitting`\n- `personalName`\n- `isTempWorker`\n\nChild -> Parent emits:\n- `submitVehicle`\n- `closeVehicle`\n\nMeaning:\n- 子组件只做表单校验和事件通知。\n- 接口请求、审批轮询、定位启动都在父页面。","x":1680,"y":-1280,"width":600,"height":540,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000114","type":"text","text":"## API 汇总\n\n扫码打卡:\n- 临时工：`attendanceTempterm`\n- 正式员工：`attendanceLongterm`\n\n车辆审批:\n- `apiModifyCarStatus(vehiclePayload, true)`\n- `apiCheckApproval`\n- `apiStopCar({ id })`\n\n轨迹上报:\n- `reportTrack([point], false)`","x":2360,"y":-1280,"width":600,"height":540,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000115","type":"text","text":"## runtime / reporter 分工\n\n`locationReporterRuntime.js`:\n- 业务页面和底层上报器之间的桥。\n- 管 `entityId / type / active`。\n- 写 `LOCATION_REPORTER_RUNTIME_STATE`。\n\n`locationReporter.js`:\n- 底层持续定位上报层。\n- 管监听、后台定位、防重复启动、失败重试。","x":3400,"y":-1000,"width":600,"height":380,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000116","type":"text","text":"## App / Store 恢复入口\n\n`App.vue onShow`:\n1. 先检查权限和 token。\n2. 先 `shouldResumeLocationReporter()`。\n3. runtime active 就直接 `startLocationReporter()`。\n4. 否则 `accountStore.resumeVehicleLocation()`。\n\n`account.js`:\n- 正式员工登录后恢复车辆定位。\n- 临时工不走车辆恢复。","x":4040,"y":-1280,"width":600,"height":380,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000170","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point：两种定位不能混看\n\nScan:\n- 一次性取当前位置。\n- `getCurrentLocationWithPermission()`。\n- 打卡接口提交 `lng / lat`。\n\nVehicle:\n- 审批通过后持续上报。\n- `startLocationReporter()`。\n- `reportTrack` 上报轨迹。","x":2920,"y":2860,"width":520,"height":360,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"2000000000000172","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point：业务缓存和 runtime 缓存\n\nWhy it is hard:\n- `attendanceVehicleState` 管业务进度。\n- `LOCATION_REPORTER_RUNTIME_STATE` 管上报器运行。\n\nRisk:\n- 合并理解会误判恢复流程。\n- 改缓存 shape 时要检查所有 reader/writer。","x":2920,"y":3340,"width":520,"height":360,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"2000000000000171","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point：两层恢复逻辑\n\nEvidence:\n- 页面有 `waitVehicleApproved / resumeVehicleApproval`。\n- store 里也有 `resumeVehicleApproval`。\n\nReason:\n- 页面打开时要恢复。\n- App 回前台、重新登录时也要恢复。\n\nRisk:\n- 改审批判断、轮询次数、缓存字段时，两边都要看。","x":3560,"y":2860,"width":520,"height":360,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"2000000000000173","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point：结束车辆后缓存未删除\n\nEvidence:\n- `handleCloseVehicle()` 后调用 `saveVehicleState()` 写空状态。\n- `logout()` 不删除 `attendanceVehicleState`。\n\nInterpretation:\n- key 可能还在，但内容表示没有正在使用车辆。\n- 重新登录后保留业务进度可能是刻意设计。","x":3560,"y":3340,"width":520,"height":360,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"2000000000000174","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point：`setLocationReporterEntityId`\n\nWhy it is hard:\n- 它看起来像普通 setter。\n- 实际会同步写 `LOCATION_REPORTER_RUNTIME_STATE`。\n\nRisk:\n- 调它会影响 App 回前台恢复判断。\n- 清空 entityId 会让 active 变 false。","x":2920,"y":3820,"width":520,"height":360,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"2000000000000153","type":"text","text":"## 四层状态分工\n\n1. 页面内存：负责当前展示。\n2. `attendanceVehicleState`：负责业务进度恢复。\n3. `LOCATION_REPORTER_RUNTIME_STATE`：负责上报器运行恢复。\n4. reporter 底层缓存：负责上报稳定性。","x":1630,"y":2880,"width":500,"height":500,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000150","type":"text","text":"## 页面内存状态\n\nOwner:\n- `attendance/index.vue`\n\nState:\n- `selectedVehicle`\n- `vehicleActive`\n- `vehicleApprovalStatus`\n- `vehicleSubmitting`\n- `scanLoading`\n- `vehicleApprovalRunId`\n\nLifecycle:\n- 页面显示期间有效。\n- 离开或刷新后依赖缓存恢复。","x":-1190,"y":2880,"width":500,"height":500,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000151","type":"text","text":"## 登录态缓存\n\nOwner:\n- `account.js`\n\nKeys:\n- `AUTHORIZATIONID`\n- `AUTHORIZATION`\n- `ACCOUNT_SOURCE`\n\nImportant:\n- 这些是登录态缓存。\n- 不要和车辆定位缓存混在一起。","x":-280,"y":2880,"width":500,"height":500,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000152","type":"text","text":"## reporter 底层缓存\n\nOwner:\n- `locationReporter.js`\n\nKeys:\n- `LOCATION_REPORT_LAST_SUCCESS_AT`\n- `LOCATION_REPORT_PENDING_PAYLOAD`\n\nPurpose:\n- 记录成功上报时间。\n- 保存失败后待重试的定位点。","x":720,"y":2880,"width":500,"height":500,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000160","type":"text","text":"## 扫码打卡链\n\nCode:\n```text\nhandleScanCodeTap\n  -> handleScanTap\n    -> getClockCoordinates\n      -> getCurrentLocationWithPermission\n        -> uni.getLocation\n          -> attendanceLongterm / attendanceTempterm\n```\n\nKey idea:\n- 只取一次定位，不启动持续上报。","x":-1310,"y":4040,"width":520,"height":340,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000163","type":"text","text":"## runtime 启动链\n\nCode:\n```text\nsetLocationReporterEntityId\n  -> write LOCATION_REPORTER_RUNTIME_STATE\nstartLocationReporter\n  -> read runtime cache\n  -> locationReporter.start\n  -> active = true\n```\n\nPurpose:\n- 把业务对象和底层上报器解耦。","x":1490,"y":4040,"width":520,"height":340,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000161","type":"text","text":"## 车辆启动链\n\nCode:\n```text\nAttendanceLocationSelector\n  -> handleSubmitVehicle\n    -> apiModifyCarStatus\n      -> waitVehicleApproved\n        -> applyLocationTarget\n          -> setLocationReporterEntityId\n          -> startLocationReporter\n```\n\nKey idea:\n- 审批通过后才启动持续定位。","x":-280,"y":4040,"width":520,"height":340,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000162","type":"text","text":"## 恢复链\n\nCode:\n```text\nonLoad / App onShow / login\n  -> read runtime or attendanceVehicleState\n  -> resumeVehicleApproval / resumeVehicleLocation\n  -> setLocationReporterEntityId\n  -> startLocationReporter\n```\n\nPurpose:\n- 页面未打开时，也能恢复车辆定位。","x":560,"y":4040,"width":520,"height":340,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000181","type":"text","text":"## 待确认 2：缓存 key 保留\n\nEvidence:\n- 结束车辆后写入空状态，而不是 remove key。\n- 退出登录也没有删除 `attendanceVehicleState`。\n\nQuestion:\n- 这是为了重新登录恢复业务进度，还是历史遗留？\n\nCurrent reading:\n- 先按刻意设计理解，重构前再问业务。","x":2580,"y":-2320,"width":800,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000180","type":"text","text":"## 待确认 1：helper 是否要内联\n\nEvidence:\n- `locationPermission.js` 是 attendance 目录下的页面专属定位权限 helper。\n\nQuestion:\n- 如果后续严格贴合 `vue-inline-simplifier`，是否要合回 `attendance/index.vue`？\n\nCurrent advice:\n- 定位权限链路风险高，先不要搬业务代码。","x":1660,"y":-2320,"width":800,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000121","type":"text","text":"## 扫码 2：准备打卡\n\nFunction:\n- `handleScanTap(codeUrl)`\n\nWork:\n- 打开 `scanLoading`。\n- 生成 `clockTime`。\n- 准备提交打卡。","x":220,"y":-40,"width":390,"height":400,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000122","type":"text","text":"## Inline State：`scanLoading`\n\nOwner:\n- `attendance/index.vue`\n\nWrite:\n- 扫码流程开始时置 true。\n- finally 置 false。\n\nPurpose:\n- 防止重复扫码。\n- 控制 loading。","x":1185,"y":-40,"width":390,"height":400,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000123","type":"text","text":"## 扫码 3：一次性定位\n\nFunction:\n- `getClockCoordinates()`\n\nCalls:\n- `getCurrentLocationWithPermission()`\n- `uni.getLocation`\n\nReturns:\n- `{ lng, lat }`","x":2110,"y":-40,"width":390,"height":400,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000124","type":"text","text":"## 扫码 4：提交打卡 API\n\nMethods:\n- 临时工：`attendanceTempterm`\n- 正式员工：`attendanceLongterm`\n\nParameters:\n- `clockTime`\n- `codeUrl`\n- `lng / lat`\n\nResult:\n- 成功提示打卡成功。","x":3200,"y":-40,"width":390,"height":400,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000133","type":"text","text":"## 车辆 3：轮询审批\n\nFunction:\n- `waitVehicleApproved()`\n\nWork:\n- 最多 180 次轮询。\n- 每 10 秒查一次。\n- 调 `apiCheckApproval`。\n- 每次更新审批状态和缓存。","x":2095,"y":640,"width":390,"height":560,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000130","type":"text","text":"## 车辆 1：填写表单\n\nComponent:\n- `AttendanceLocationSelector`\n\nAction:\n- 校验车辆表单。\n- emit `submitVehicle`。\n\nImportant:\n- 子组件不调接口，不启动定位。","x":-815,"y":640,"width":390,"height":560,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000131","type":"text","text":"## 车辆 2：创建审批单\n\nParent:\n- `handleSubmitVehicle(vehicle)`\n\nWork:\n- 组装 `vehiclePayload`。\n- 调 `apiModifyCarStatus`。\n- 拿到审批单 id。","x":205,"y":640,"width":390,"height":560,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000132","type":"text","text":"## Inline Cache：`attendanceVehicleState`\n\nRole:\n- 车辆业务缓存。\n\nWrite:\n- 提交车辆后写“审批中”。\n- 轮询时更新审批状态。\n- 结束用车后写空状态。\n\nRead:\n- 页面重新进入。\n- App 回前台兜底。\n- 正式员工重新登录。","x":1170,"y":640,"width":390,"height":560,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000134","type":"text","text":"## Inline Runtime：定位目标\n\nWhen approved:\n- `applyLocationTarget()`\n- `setLocationReporterEntityId(车牌号, 1)`\n\nWrite:\n- `LOCATION_REPORTER_RUNTIME_STATE.entityId`\n- `type = 1`","x":3185,"y":640,"width":390,"height":560,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000135","type":"text","text":"## 车辆 4：启动持续定位\n\nFunction:\n- `startLocationReporter()`\n\nResult:\n- runtime active = true。\n- 调到底层 `locationReporter.start()`。\n- 通过 `reportTrack` 上报轨迹。","x":4025,"y":640,"width":390,"height":560,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000136","type":"text","text":"## 车辆 5：结束用车\n\nTrigger:\n- 子组件 emit `closeVehicle`。\n\nParent:\n- `handleCloseVehicle()`\n\nWork:\n- 调 `apiStopCar({ id })`。\n- 停止定位。\n- 写入空车辆状态。","x":4825,"y":640,"width":390,"height":560,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000143","type":"text","text":"## 恢复 3：正式员工登录\n\nEntry:\n- `accountStore.login()`\n\nAfter:\n- `getSystemInfo(true)`\n- `resumeVehicleLocation()`\n\nNot for:\n- `loginTempWorker()`。","x":2095,"y":1440,"width":390,"height":480,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000144","type":"text","text":"## Inline Store：`accountStore`\n\nRole:\n- App 级车辆定位恢复入口。\n\nReads:\n- `attendanceVehicleState`\n\nCalls:\n- `setLocationReporterEntityId`\n- `startLocationReporter`\n- store 内部 `resumeVehicleApproval`。","x":3185,"y":1440,"width":390,"height":480,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000145","type":"text","text":"## 恢复 4：继续审批或启动定位\n\nIf active:\n- 直接重启 reporter。\n\nIf approving:\n- 继续查审批。\n\nIf approved but inactive:\n- 再启动持续定位。","x":4025,"y":1440,"width":390,"height":480,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000140","type":"text","text":"## 恢复 1：页面重新进入\n\nEntry:\n- `onLoad`\n- `restoreVehicleState()`\n\nRead:\n- `attendanceVehicleState`\n\nNext:\n- 需要时继续 `resumeVehicleApproval()`。","x":-815,"y":1440,"width":390,"height":480,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000141","type":"text","text":"## 恢复 2：App 回前台\n\nEntry:\n- `App.vue onShow`\n\nRead first:\n- `LOCATION_REPORTER_RUNTIME_STATE`\n\nFallback:\n- 再让 store 读业务缓存。","x":205,"y":1440,"width":390,"height":480,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000142","type":"text","text":"## Inline Runtime：`LOCATION_REPORTER_RUNTIME_STATE`\n\nRole:\n- 定位上报器运行缓存。\n\nFields:\n- `entityId`\n- `type`\n- `active`\n\nRead:\n- App 回前台先读它。","x":1170,"y":1440,"width":390,"height":480,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000111","type":"text","text":"## `AttendanceLocationSelector.vue`\n\nRole:\n- 车辆使用表单和状态展示组件。\n- 不直接调接口，不直接开定位。\n\nDepends on:\n- 父页面 props：`selectedVehicle / vehicleActive / approvalStatus / submitting`。\n- 内部 `computed` 推导禁用、按钮、状态文案。\n\nAffects:\n- emit `submitVehicle`\n- emit `closeVehicle`\n- 表单校验、回显、字段联动。","x":-105,"y":-1600,"width":520,"height":460,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000110","type":"text","text":"## `attendance/index.vue`\n\nRole:\n- 考勤首页父页面。\n- 同时管首页 UI、扫码打卡、车辆审批、车辆持续定位、本地缓存恢复。\n\nDepends on:\n- `AttendanceLocationSelector`\n- `locationPermission.js`\n- account / permission store\n- 车辆审批、打卡接口\n- location reporter runtime\n\nAffects:\n- 写 `attendanceVehicleState`\n- 启停车辆持续定位\n- 给子组件传 props，接收 emit。","x":-800,"y":-1370,"width":520,"height":520,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2000000000000112","type":"text","text":"## `locationPermission.js`\n\nRole:\n- 扫码打卡前的一次性定位权限 helper。\n- 只负责前台定位权限和 `uni.getLocation`。\n\nDepends on:\n- `uni.getSetting`\n- `uni.authorize`\n- `uni.openSetting`\n- `uni.getLocation`\n\nAffects:\n- 返回一次当前位置。\n- 不负责车辆持续定位，不写 runtime。","x":-40,"y":-1010,"width":520,"height":460,"color":"#ffffff"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"3000000000000101","fromNode":"2000000000000101","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"2000000000000102","toSide":"top","label":"source note"},
